"console's options are listed in the next chapter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:152
msgid "The master secret"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:154
msgid ""
"Without ``--secret-file`` or ``SIBUNA_SECRET`` the daemon draws a random "
"seed, and the banner prints \"random (set --secret-file)\". Tokens and "
"challenges then die with the process, and a cluster whose nodes hold "
"different seeds will reject each other's cookies. Generate one with "
"``head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret`` and mode "
"0600."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:156
msgid "Console Preview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:159
msgid ""
"The console is compiled into the daemon by the default ``console`` "
"feature, but starts only with ``--console``. It needs storage: "
"``--console`` without ``--data-dir`` or ``--database-url`` is refused "
"with ``CONSOLE001`` (``StorageRequired``). Use ``cargo build --release -p "
"sibuna --no-default-features --features sqlite`` to compile it out; a "
"build with ``--no-default-features`` alone has neither storage nor "
"console. Bootstrap locally while the daemon is stopped:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:166
msgid ""
"``sibuna console init-admin`` is the same command. Open "
"``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` and replace the generated temporary "
"password, which must be changed at the first sign-in and expires after "
"one hour. The signed-in navigation provides the animated country globe, "
"request and challenge statistics, incident investigation, policy and "
"inspection editors, users, scoped API tokens, audit and serving-node "
"controls. The authentication shell loads no globe geometry or telemetry. "
"The interface is a WebAssembly module built from ``cmd/console-ui`` "
"(crate ``sibuna-console-ui``) by the daemon's build script; it and the "
"committed stylesheet ship with ordinary builds."
msgstr ""

